  "analysis": "All four secret strings are now gone (grep returned exit code 1 = no matches). Now I should verify the placeholders were inserted correctly and check that no other hardcoded secrets exist. Let me confirm the replacements look right in both files and do a final broader scan for any remaining literal credentials.",
